meta {
  name: Get a user profile
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/users/{{username}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  Public profile: `username`, `displayName`, `followerCount`, `followingCount`.

  Deliberately carries no per-viewer state (no "am I following them?"), because
  this response is cached and shared across viewers. That question is
  `Me follows / Get my relationship to a user` instead.

  `username` is `citext`, so `/users/RGrassian` and `/users/rgrassian` are the
  same person.

  - 200 the profile
  - 404 no such username
}
